--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_exists_algEquiv_laurentBaseChange_qExpFunctionFieldC_coeffMap_apply_eq_of_slash_heckeDiagMatrix.lean

